// ============================================================================
// Google SecOps (Chronicle) UDM Hunting Queries
// Advisory: Volt Typhoon KV-Botnet Edge Router Zero-Day & Living-off-the-Land Campaign (CVE-2026-21409)
// Severity: Critical | Actor: Volt Typhoon | Malware: KV-Botnet
